{
  "name": "Stripe invoice when a Pipedrive deal is won",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "aa718a73-7538-4efd-a7ca-7be2c33c1281",
      "name": "Setup notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -420,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Invoice on deal close\n\nWhen a deal first becomes Won, look up the person, reuse or create a Stripe customer by email, add an invoice item for the deal value, finalize a send-invoice, email it, and write the hosted URL back to the Pipedrive deal as a note.\n\nZero-value deals and deals with no person email are announced in Slack and not invoiced.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "441ec5f8-1c34-4556-9848-35f059909e56",
